      "content": "i know i should reach out but it feels pointless. like even if i talk to someone, i still have to wake up tomorrow and do it all over again. the cycle just never ends. i'm just so done with the effort of it all. it feels like there's no actual relief, just more noise and more weight. it makes me wonder why anyone even bothers to keep going when it's this hard.",
